  Browser --> Edge
  Edge --> App
  App --> Assets
  App --> AgentHealth
  App --> Api
  Api --> LocalRuntime
  Api --> Providers
  App --> Evidence
  AgentHealth --> Evidence
  Api --> Evidence

  Browser -. slow device or weak network .-> App
  App -. disable non-critical motion and heavy evidence media .-> Assets
  AgentHealth -. runtime offline .-> App
  Api -. timeout or retry exhausted .-> App

